UID:6ae210a129c3d6003332ffc4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Minions & Monsters\, released in 2026.  Our film 
 tells the story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood\, became movie star
 s\, unleashed monsters on the world\, and then tried to save the planet fr
 om the mayhem they created.\nThis movie is rated PG and is recommended for
  children aged 8 and up with parent or caregiver.  Drop in.  Space is li
 mited.
