BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bob the Magician
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261228T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261228T150000
UID:6adfb0269dbc2b002c912760@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:​Enjoy a fun magic show at the library! Bob The Magician​
  presents his one-man magic show to entertain all! Bob combines side-split
 ting comedy\, visual magic and audience participation to entertain all age
 s.\nAfter being fascinated with legendary magician “Harry Houdini”\, B
 ob developed an interest in magic at the age of thirteen.  He has been per
 forming magic and escapes since 1978.  In October of 1983\, he managed to 
 escape after being chained and thrown in Lake Ontario.\nAges 6+. Drop-in\
 , no registration required.
LOCATION:Victoria Village\, Program room\, downstairs.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6adfb0269dbc2b002c912760
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
