DESCRIPTION:Piskel can be used to create game sprites (i.e.\, 2D images ov
 erlaid onto a scene)\, animations\, pixel-art for social media\, etc. This
  software gives you the ability to paint and erase pixels\, resize pixel a
 rt to a bigger scale\, create animation sheets for games\, and more.\nSpac
 e is limited. Bring a USB stick if you'd like to save your work.
