DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun and interactive Kahoot! program at the libra
 ry! Children will test their knowledge\, learn new facts\, and enjoy frien
 dly competition through exciting\, age-appropriate quizzes. Participants w
 ill answer questions using Kahoot!\, covering topics such as books\, anima
 ls\, science\, general knowledge\, and more. This engaging program encoura
 ges learning\, participation\, and teamwork in a fun library setting\n.\nR
 egistration required. Space is limited. For children Ages 6 - 12.
