DESCRIPTION:In this hands-on robotics workshop\, participants will build a
 nd program a remote controlled car using 3D-printed parts and electronic c
 omponents in groups. They’ll explore how mechanical\, electrical\, and p
 rogramming systems work together to create a functional robot.\nParticipan
 ts will:\nBuild a car using 3D-printed components\nConnect ESP32 microcont
 rollers\, motor drivers\, and DC motors\nLearn basic wiring and electronic
 s\nProgram their robot for wireless control\nTest\, troubleshoot\, and dri
 ve their completed car
LOCATION:Yorkville
