DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261122T150000
UID:6acfc46711bbf300684c06d5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our weekly\nSTEAM Lab (Ages 6-12)\n\, where kids c
 an explore science\, technology\, engineering\, art\, and math through fun
 \, hands-on activities. From building simple robots and experimenting with
  Snap Circuits to creative design challenges and more\, there’s always s
 omething new to discover.\nActivities change each week\, so there’s alwa
 ys something new to explore!
LOCATION:Hillcrest\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6acfc46711bbf300684c06d5
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
