UID:6abbfb71ebad22004541cbf3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the 2nd floor every Saturday for a few games of che
 ss in a welcoming environment.\nAll ages and all levels are welcome. Chil
 dren must be accompanied by a parent or guardian to participate. Any unsup
 ervised individuals under 18 will not be able to participate in the progra
 m.\nPlease note: There is no chess club on Sat Nov 21 for our Big Fall Boo
 k Sale\nThis is a drop-in program.
