DESCRIPTION:The Moomins are kind creatures with velvety fur and round snou
 ts\, who live in a tall blue house in a valley beside the sea. When a come
 t appears\, young Moomintroll and his friend Sniff travel to the Lonely Mo
 untains to consult the professors. They face challenges\, adventures and m
 ysteries before completing their trek.\nKids and their parents are invited
  to read the book together and then meet to talk about it with other child
 ren and parents.\nCopies available at the library\nComet in Moominland
LOCATION:Mimico Centennial\, Meeting Room
