 NCE for your 2 participants (child and caregiver).\n(Re)discover the joy 
 of reading in this relaxed family program for kids and their parents or ca
 regivers. Each week\, explore a new story or the next chapter of a favouri
 te book together. Then\, head on your own reading adventures and enjoy ind
 ependent reading and playful story remixing with family and friends.\nThis
  is a 6-week program and participants are recommended to attend all 6 sess
 ions.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this fo
 rm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries A
