BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:After School Club - Picture a Story with Ruth Ohi
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T170000
UID:6ac90a24c6cddb00459624d6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For children ages 6 - 12.\nLooking for something to do after s
 chool? Come out to our After School Club and learn new things\, make stuff
 \, meet other kids and have fun! This month\, author Ruth Ohi will be lead
 ing a workshop for kids!\nDo you like to draw\, write or create comics? Th
 rough fun interactive brainstorming games\, with lots of drawing and writi
 ng opportunities\, come create characters and the worlds they live in. All
  art and writing supplies provided – all you need to bring is your imagi
 nation!\nRegistration is required and begins Oct 24th at 9 am.\nSnacks ar
 e offered during the After School Club for participants. Ingredient lists 
 will be available. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by donors.\
 nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is 
 collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, s
 ections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for e
 vent and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about h
 ow the library handles your information can be directed to Answerline staf
 f at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M
 4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac90a24c6cddb00459624d6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
