BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Celebrate 60 years of Mimico Centennial Library
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261101T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261130T235959
UID:6abfe43a9dbc2b002c8bcccd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Throughout November\, we're celebrating the\n60th anniversary
  of Mimico Centennial Library\n! Take a walk through history with our spec
 ial\nhistorical photo display\n\, featuring images and newspaper articles 
 of the library and surrounding Mimico community through the years. Discove
 r how our neighbourhood has changed and revisit the people\, places\, and 
 moments that have shaped our community.\n60 years of stories. 60 years of 
 memories. 60 years of community.
LOCATION:Mimico Centennial\, Front lawn and first floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6abfe43a9dbc2b002c8bcccd
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
