DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T170000
UID:6a88a653aafa6100295e3112@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun!\nFor ages 6-12.\nRegistration is required.\nSnacks are offered durin
 g the After School Club for participants\, beginning at 3:45pm. Ingredient
  lists will be available. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by d
 onors.\nUpcoming Topics:\nMon Sept 14: Dash Robotics\nMon Sept 21: Craft\
 nMon Sept 28: SNAP circuits\nMon Oct 5th: Dash robotics\, In this program
 \, learn about Kids Vote Weekend!\nMon October 19th: Craft\nMon October 26
 th: SNAP circuits\nMon November 2nd: SPHERO robotics\nMon November 9th:Cra
 ft\nMon November 16th: SNAP circuits\nMon November 23rd: Dash robotics\nMo
 nday November 30th: Craft\nMonday December 7th: ASC switched to a differen
 t day for special PULL program\nMonday December 14th: ASC switched to diff
 erent day for special PULL program\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe pe
 rsonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library
  under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The 
 information will only be used for event and program registration\, deliver
 y and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your information
  can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-598
 1\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Gerrard/Ashdale\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a88a653aafa6100295e3112
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
