DESCRIPTION:Want to learn how to knit or crochet with a fun group of peopl
 e? Looking for help with your project?\nYou can also share your projects w
 ith others\, teach or learn a technique\, and enjoy great conversation.\nA
 ll levels of expertise are welcome.\nBring your own yarn\, needles\, and c
 rochet hooks.\nDrop-in only.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
