 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages\n6-12.\nThis is a special Afterschool Club! Join profession
 al artists in a fun and exciting community based arts program. This worksh
 op offers an introduction into the enriching world of art and creativity t
 hrough Poetry\, Music\, Theatre and Visual Arts.\nPresented by Tiger Princ
