DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270109T143000
UID:6ae09da4ebad220045483cf9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for tour of our current TD Gallery exhibition\,\nA Le
 gacy in Motion: The National Ballet of Canada at 75\n! This tour will be j
 ointly hosted by TPL and the Archivist from The National Ballet of Canada
  Archives.\nExplore 75 years of The National Ballet of Canada through arch
 ival content from Toronto Public Library Special Collections and The Natio
 nal Ballet of Canada Archives.\nFeaturing costume designs\, photography\, 
 show worn costumes and more!\nRegistration is not required but encouraged.
 \nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is
  collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, 
 sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for 
