  generously supported\, in part\, by donors.\nThursday\, October 29: Hallo
 ween Party  Celebrate at the library with crafts\, games\, and a scavenge
 r hunt.  The craft will be separated into 2 SESSIONS:\nJUNIORS  3:45 - 4:
 25 for children ages 6 and 7\nSENIORS  4:30 - 5:15 for children ages 8-12\
 nThursday\, November 5: Board Games.\nRelax with friends--or make some ne
 w ones--playing classic board games.  Parents and caregivers are welcome 
 too!\nThursday\, November 12:  Applefun Puppetry Workshop.\nFor children 
 6 -- 12.  Space is limited.\nThursday\, November\, 19:  Robotics with Bl
 uebots.\nThis program is separated into 2 sessions\, 1 for each age group.
 \nJ\nUNIORS 3:45 - 4:25 for children ages 6 and 7\nSENIORS 4:30 - 5:15 for
  children ages 8-12\nThursday\, November 26:  Crafternoon.\nThis programs
