SUMMARY:Maker's Club - Rainbow Snowflake Magic Wand
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261117T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261117T190000
UID:6adccf74ebad22004547ab71@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Add a little colour and magic to winter! Children will love cr
 eating their very own Rainbow Snowflake Magic Wand\, using beautiful tie-d
 ye colours and wintery snowflake designs.  Come create some rainbow magic
  with us.
LOCATION:Elmbrook Park\, Program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6adccf74ebad22004547ab71
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
