BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Introduction to 3D Printing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T190000
UID:6ae220f5377296003a4f3f41@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this lecture style introductory class\, you will learn all 
 you need to know about 3D printing. How to find models online\, how to pre
 pare them for printing using a slicing software and how to print them usin
